    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n102536" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταύρεος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταύρειος, κόλλα</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.1672.161
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ τ. τύμπανα</span>”
				<i>Lyr. Alex.Adesp.</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					37.16
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τ. κέρατα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Orph.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					168.14
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζωστήρια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PLond.</u>
					2.402v
				</span></i>
			.<i><span class="en">
				8
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> epith. of Poseidon in Boeotia (cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταῦρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1.2
				</span></i>
			), <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Sc.</u>
				104
			</span></i>, because bulls were offered to him at Onchestus, acc. to
			Sch.; written <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ταύρειος</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταῦρος</span>
			; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ταύριος</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i></div>
